# A showcase for the .http request format (the JetBrains HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client form).
// Both comment styles are allowed. Every address is under example.com (RFC 2606).

@host = api.example.com
@token = example-not-a-real-token

### List open orders, with placeholders and a protocol version
GET https://{{host}}/v1/orders?status=open&limit=20 HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an order with a JSON body
POST https://{{host}}/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Acme Widgets",
  "priority": 2,
  "express": true,
  "gift_note": null,
  "items": [{ "sku": "WID-001", "quantity": 3 }]
}

### A form body and a header value holding a colon
put https://{{host}}/v1/orders/1042/address
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
If-Match: "v3:2026-10-03T09:00:00Z"

line1=12+Example+Street&city=Springfield

### Every method word the format accepts
PATCH https://{{host}}/v1/orders/1042
DELETE https://{{host}}/v1/drafts/77
HEAD https://{{host}}/v1/status
OPTIONS https://{{host}}/v1/orders
